# Accessibility

- Navigation is a `<Link>`. An in-page action is a `<button type="button">`. Do not nest a button inside a link, and do not use a clickable `<div>`.
- An icon-only button has an `aria-label`.
- An image has meaningful `alt`. A decorative image uses `alt=""`.
- Do not remove a focus outline unless a visible replacement is in its place.
- Heading levels stay in order (`h1`, then `h2`). Use the landmarks the layout already has.
